[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u307E\u305A\u3044\u306A\u3042\u2026\u2026\n\u3000\u3053\u306E\u4F9D\u983C\u3001\u307E\u3060\u6B8B\u3063\u3066\u308B\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(This isn\u0027t good...\nI still have that request to deal with.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u671F\u65E5\u3082\u8FEB\u3063\u3066\u308B\u3057\u3001\n\u3000\u65AD\u308B\u304F\u3089\u3044\u306A\u3089\u3001\u3044\u3063\u305D\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The deadline\u0027s coming up soon.\nMaybe instead of turning it down...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u3093\u306B\u3061\u306F\u3001\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6\u5148\u8F29\uFF01\n\u3042\u308C\u3001\u96E3\u3057\u3044\u9854\u3067\u3059\u306D\u3001\u3069\u3046\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hello, Miss Ryza!\nOh, you look troubled. Is something wrong?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3084\u30FC\u3001\u671F\u65E5\u306E\u8FD1\u3044\u4F9D\u983C\u304C\u3042\u308B\u3093\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3001\n\u53D7\u3051\u308B\u4EBA\u304C\u3044\u306A\u3044\u3093\u3060\u3088\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well... I\u0027ve got this request with a close deadline,\nbut I can\u0027t find anyone to take it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u308F\u3063\u3002\u3053\u3053\u306F\u3001\u5F37\u3044\u9B54\u7269\u304C\u51FA\u308B\u3068\u3044\u3046\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh! Is this about those dangerous monsters?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u2026\u2026\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3001\u3069\u3046\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s right... What do you say, Resna?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6\u5148\u8F29\u76F4\u3005\u306E\u3054\u6307\u540D\u3001\n\u8EAB\u306B\u4F59\u308B\u5149\u6804\u3067\u3059\uFF01 \u6B23\u559C\u96C0\u8E8D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A personal invitation from Miss Ryza herself!\nI\u0027m overjoyed! Absolutely thrilled!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u3067\u3059\u306D\u3001\u3044\u3055\u3055\u304B\u81EA\u4FE1\u304C\u2026\u2026\n\u5931\u6557\u3057\u305F\u3089\u3001\u3054\u8FF7\u60D1\u3092\u304A\u304B\u3051\u3057\u3066\u3057\u307E\u3044\n\u305D\u3046\u3067\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But you see, I\u0027m not entirely confident...\nI\u0027d feel terrible if I ended up causing you trouble..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3063\u304B\u3041\u3002\u2026\u2026\u3058\u3083\u3042\u3001\n\u3042\u305F\u3057\u304C\u53D7\u3051\u3061\u3083\u304A\u3046\u304B\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see... Well then,\nmaybe I should just take it myself."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u3049\uFF01\uFF01\n\u3055\u3059\u304C\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6\u5148\u8F29\u3001\u306A\u3093\u3066\u983C\u3082\u3057\u3044\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ooh!!\nAs expected of Miss Ryza, how reliable!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u306E\u8155\u524D\u3092\u9593\u8FD1\u3067\u62DD\u898B\u3057\u305F\u304F\u3001\n\u6050\u6016\u5FC3\u304C\u5439\u304D\u98DB\u3093\u3067\u3057\u307E\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The thought of seeing your skills up close\nhas completely blown away my fears!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u82E5\u8F29\u8005\u3067\u6050\u7E2E\u3067\u3059\u304C\u3001\n\u3053\u306E\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u30FB\u30B7\u30E5\u30C6\u30EB\u30CD\u30F3\u30EA\u30D2\u30C8\uFF01\n\u304A\u4F9B\u3055\u305B\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Though I may be inexperienced,\nI, Resna Sternenlicht,\nwould be honored to accompany you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7528\u5FC3\u68D2\u306B\u4EFB\u547D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Appoint as bodyguard"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3080\uFF01\u3000\u3067\u306F\u7528\u5FC3\u68D2\u306B\u4EFB\u547D\u3057\u3088\u3046\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Very well! I hereby appoint you as my bodyguard!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6050\u60A6\u81F3\u6975\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m deeply honored!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3059\u3050\u306B\u7206\u5F3E\u3084\u85AC\u3092\u5927\u91CF\u306B\u7528\u610F\u3057\u307E\u3059\u306D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027ll prepare lots of bombs and medicine right away!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8377\u7269\u6301\u3061\u306B\u4EFB\u547D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Appoint as item carrier"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3044\u5FC3\u304C\u3051\u3060\uFF01 \u8377\u7269\u6301\u3061\u3092\u983C\u3080\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s the spirit! I\u0027ll leave the carrying to you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u4EFB\u305B\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Leave it to me!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3089\u3093\u9650\u308A\u306E\uFF01\u3000\u304B\u3054\u3084\u5BB9\u5668\u3092\u3070\uFF01\uFF01\n\u304B\u304D\u96C6\u3081\u3066\u307E\u3044\u308A\u307E\u3059\uFF01\uFF01\uFF01\u3000\u3084\u30FC\uFF01\uFF01\uFF01\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I shall gather! Every basket and container!\nThat I can find!! YEAH!!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u5F01\u5F53\u4FC2\u306B\u4EFB\u547D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Appoint as lunch maker"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u3089\u3070\u3001\u304A\u5F01\u5F53\u4FC2\u306B\u4EFB\u547D\u3059\u308B\uFF01\n\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u306E\u624B\u6599\u7406\u3001\u697D\u3057\u307F\u3060\u306A\uFF5E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "In that case, I appoint you as our lunch maker!\nI can\u0027t wait to try your cooking~"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6599\u7406\u306A\u3089\u3001\u5C11\u3057\u306F\u899A\u3048\u304C\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059\uFF01\n\u8155\u306B\u3088\u308A\u3092\u304B\u3051\u3066\u3001\u3054\u7528\u610F\u3057\u307E\u3059\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I do know a thing or two about cooking!\nI\u0027ll prepare something special!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4E00\u90E8\u306E\u6750\u6599\u306F\u3001\u73FE\u5730\u8ABF\u9054\u3057\u3066\u3082\u3044\u3044\u3067\u3059\u306D\u3002\n\u8ABF\u5473\u6599\u306F\u3069\u3046\u3057\u3088\u3046\u304B\u306A\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We could gather some ingredients on location.\nNow, about the seasonings..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3084\u3044\u3084\u3001\u5197\u8AC7\u3060\u3063\u3066\uFF01\n\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u983C\u308A\u306B\u3057\u3066\u308B\u304B\u3089\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No no, I was just kidding!\nI\u0027m really counting on you, you know!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3078\u3078\u3002\u52C7\u307F\u8DB3\u3067\u3057\u305F\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ehehe. I got a bit carried away."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u96E3\u6240\u306E\u4E0D\u5B89\u306F\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059\u304C\u3001\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6\u5148\u8F29\u3068\u306E\n\u65C5\u7A0B\u3092\u601D\u3046\u3060\u3051\u3067\u80F8\u304C\u9AD8\u9CF4\u308A\u307E\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Though I\u0027m nervous about the dangerous parts,\nmy heart\u0027s racing just thinking about traveling with you, Miss Ryza!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3059\u304C\u3001\u307B\u3093\u306E\u5C11\u3057\u5FC3\u914D\u306A\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u304A\u4F9B\u3067\u304D\u308B\u304B\u3069\u3046\u304B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But I am a little worried.\nWhether I can really keep up..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3001\u3069\u3046\u3057\u3066\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Eh, why\u0027s that?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u3001\u307E\u3060\u307E\u3060\u672A\u719F\u8005\u3067\u3059\u304B\u3089\u2026\u2026\n\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6\u5148\u8F29\u306E\u304A\u5F79\u306B\u7ACB\u3066\u308B\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m still so inexperienced...\nWill I really be able to help you, Miss Ryza?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u529B\u3092\u5408\u308F\u305B\u308C\u3070\u554F\u984C\u306A\u3044\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Together we can handle anything!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u529B\u3092\u5408\u308F\u305B\u308C\u3070\u554F\u984C\u306A\u3044\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Together we can handle anything!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u306E\u4E0D\u5B89\u306F\u308F\u304B\u308B\u3051\u3069\u3001\n\u5F37\u3051\u308C\u3070\u4E00\u4EBA\u3067\u3082\u4E07\u5168\u3063\u3066\u308F\u3051\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u3057",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I understand your worries, but being strong\ndoesn\u0027t mean you have to do everything alone."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3001\u4E00\u7DD2\u306B\u9811\u5F35\u308D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So let\u0027s do our best together!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306F\u3044\uFF01\u3000\u4E0D\u8096\u306E\u5F8C\u8F29\u3067\u306F\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059\u304C\u3001\n\u7CBE\u4E00\u676F\u3064\u3044\u3066\u3086\u304D\u307E\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes! Though I may be an unworthy junior,\nI\u0027ll give it my all to keep up!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
